  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Từ hình vẽ ta thấy, khối tròn xoay sinh ra bởi hình <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> cũng chính là khối tròn xoay sinh ra bởi hình <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> giới hạn bởi các đường <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>ln</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> quay quanh trục <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tThể tích cần tìm là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>V</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>π</mi><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>ln</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup>